t, and the service reports healthy with an error rate of about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is a SEV2 for checkout-api. It describes the failure, the rollback and the recovered numbers, and notes that the cause of the v2.3.1 failure needs to be found before it's deployed again.", "type": "text"}]}]}